em  i didn't even know what a boundary was  so to talk about that  and to find the liberation to ask for  help what are boundaries how do we learn  them how do we apply them to ourselves  and then our children  and to speak honestly about that it is  hard to figure out how to be a good  human it is hard to raise ourselves let  alone children and your platform allowed  me to come out and get out of my comfort  zone  so thank you for having this profound  conversation with me  and i must say eliza you have changed my  life so thank you elisa dr elizabeth  you can listen to the new episode of  raising good humans tomorrow on apple or  spotify or wherever you cast your pods  [Music]
 

